<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">The connections you've drawn between Cahoone's concepts and RSVP are substantive:</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Methodological alignment</strong>: Both approaches reject foundationalism in favor of local, fallibilist frameworks. Your RSVP's "sheaf-theoretic patching" mathematically implements Cahoone's "local metaphysics."</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Emergence formalization</strong>: Cahoone's emphasis on downward causation through "pruning trajectories" maps naturally onto your entropy-vector coupling equations where system-level entropy S feeds back into component dynamics.</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Orders correspondence</strong>: The five-fold hierarchy (physical→material→biological→mental→cultural) provides a natural organizational structure for RSVP's field regimes, with each transition marked by complexity thresholds.</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Teleonomy</strong>: Cahoone's distinction between teleonomy (purpose without mind) and teleology (purpose with mind) aligns with your formalization of homeostatic attractors versus recursive entropy modeling.</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">For integrating this into your bibliography structure, you could treat this as a working commentary that bridges philosophical naturalism with your mathematical framework. The key insight is that RSVP doesn't just mathematize Cahoone's concepts but provides testable field-theoretic implementations of his ontological commitments.</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">The most valuable connection may be the shared rejection of reductionism without falling into mysticism - both frameworks maintain that higher-order phenomena are genuinely causal while remaining naturalistically grounded.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 py-2"></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-2 pointer-events-none" style="transform: none;"><div class="rounded-lg transition min-w-max pointer-events-auto translate-x-2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><button class="inline-flex
