<p class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Inflation energy budget</strong>: Inflation doesn't "put in" gravitational potential energy. Inflationary models propose that quantum fluctuations in the inflaton field created the initial density perturbations, but the total energy balance was already near zero before inflation began. The gravitational potential energy exists because matter clumps, not because inflation injected energy.</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Void expansion mechanism</strong>: You haven't specified what physical mechanism drives void expansion beyond gravitational dynamics. Standard cosmology shows that voids grow because matter flows out of them gravitationally - they're not actively expanding due to some void-specific force. If you're proposing a new mechanism, it needs mathematical specification.</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Energy accounting problems</strong>: Even in zero-energy models, the energy components must balance precisely. Gravitational potential energy is negative, matter energy is positive, but their evolution over time follows specific differential equations (Friedmann equations). Your model needs to show how entropy dynamics produces the same evolutionary history without invoking spacetime expansion.</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Observable consequences</strong>: Zero total energy doesn't eliminate the need to explain why we observe specific redshift-distance relationships, time dilation effects, and CMB features. These observations constrain the dynamics regardless of the total energy budget.</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">Your framework jumps between different scales (local thermodynamics, cosmic energy balance, observational cosmology) without demonstrating mathematical consistency between them. The individual pieces may have merit, but connecting them requires showing that entropy-driven dynamics produce the same observational signatures as expansion models, not just invoking energy conservation principles.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 py-2"></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-2 pointer-events-none" style="transform: none;"><div class="rounded-lg transition min-w-max pointer-events-auto translate-x-2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><button class="inline-flex
