b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Dictionary section – show the mapping from Burton’s “curvature fluctuation entropy” to RSVP’s .</li></ol><ol class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Action/constraint functional – demonstrate how Einstein’s expectation equations emerge as Ehrenfest equations under entropy maximization.</li></ol><ol class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Redshift transport law – rewrite expansion pressure as RSVP’s .</li></ol><ol class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Threshold condition – frame EAT as  in RSVP.</li></ol><ol class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Production models – give the curvature-smoothing and info-theoretic options, so readers see how to compute .</li></ol><ol class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Observable hooks – distance duality, , redshift drift, growth—all explicit tests.</li></ol><ol class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Minimal pipeline – a “ready to run” recipe connecting RSVP lattice outputs to cosmological data.</li></ol><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">That way, readers see Burton not just as a historical parallel, but as empirical support for your plenum formalism.</p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Would you like me to reformat this into LaTeX appendix style, so you can just slot it into Gravity as Entropy Descent or The Fall of Space with equations already typeset and sections numbered?</p></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-2 pointer-events-none" style="transform: none;"><div class="rounded-lg transition min-w-max pointer-events-auto translate-y-4 bg-bg-100/80 backdrop-blur-sm translate-x-1 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 border-0.5 border-border-300 p-0.5 shadow-sm opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><button class="inline-flex
